  "historyNote": "(See Revision Note at chapter heading for Liq 600) #13983, eff 5-24-24; ss by #14515, EMERGENCY, eff 2-17-26; ss by #14520, EMERGENCY, eff 2-25-26, EXPIRED: 8-24-26, reverted back to #13983",
